# Owners are requested for review automatically, and every protected branch
# requires their approval for the paths they own. The last matching pattern wins.
# A PR's author can't approve it, so a sole owner's own PRs to these paths
# need another owner or an admin bypass. Add a second owner to avoid that.

# Repository automation: a PR that edits the branch-policy workflow could make
# its own check pass, so these paths always need a maintainer.
/.github/               @SumitMandal
/githooks/              @SumitMandal
/scripts/               @SumitMandal

